        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00060:alt:fig-00003-alt",
          "text": "The structure of ethanol with prochiral C2  labeled. Forms another compound, in which the C2  is bonded to X instead of hydrogen and labeled chirality center."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_05_11_003.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
