        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00060:alt:fig-00004-alt",
          "text": "The structure of ethanol with prochiral C2  labeled  leads to the formation of two chiral compounds, one with C2  labeled R and other with C2  labeled S."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_05_11_004.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
